\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab A translator or programming language processor is a computer program that performs the translation of a program written in a given programming language into a functionally equivalent program in another computer language (the target language), without losing the functional or logical structure of the original code (the "essence" of each program).\par
